// Bandit Level 15 → Level 16

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 15 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit15@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 14.

Step3: The next password must be submitted to a service running on port `30001` using SSL/TLS.

Step4: Use `openssl s_client` to establish an SSL connection to the service:

        openssl s_client -connect localhost:30001

Step5: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 14 and press Enter.

Step6: The service returns the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit16`.

Step7: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit16@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step8: The Bandit Level 15 → Level 16 challenge is solved.

Step9: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
